Core, `npm test` (tsc + vitest) after all core changes: 48 files, 500/500 passed.

Runner, final full run with real sandboxed Lean (LEAN_NUM_THREADS=4, TELELEAN_NO_REAL_CLAUDE=1, temp trees in my scratch dir): 57 files, 561 tests, 559 passed, 1 skipped, 1 failed, in 823 s.
- The one failure is `test/run/prompts.test.ts` "still matches section 5.1 of docs/m2-plan.md". It is expected until the docs patch below is applied: the fixture copy matches `buildSystemPrompt()`, and I checked by script that the patched doc's block equals the fixture.
- This run includes:
  - `walkthrough.e2e` (AT3.14 a/b and all 20 AT3.15 cheat scripts);
  - `integration/m2flow` (including (c): a far edit merges, a stance edit in a pinned block is still a conflict);
